id: pm-vcs-switch-cache
title: Preflight status refresh mutates index before refused operations
description: "Isolated release:check exposed cache writes before a private-layer switch refusal. Deterministic cold indexes with real files aged beyond RACY_WINDOW_NS also expose attached and detached rewrite refusals. Conflict resolution uses the same status path. Internal preflight status reads must not publish optional index cache observations; ordinary public status retains cache warming. Existing real repository refusal regressions are strengthened, including overlapping conflict resolution."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-18T10:20:47.215Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-18T10:27:17.271Z"
assignee: codex-agent
claim_principal: codex-agent
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: "Real switch refusal preserves raw index, HEAD, refs, operations and private working bytes with optional stat observations absent. Regression fails with only preflight ordering reverted. Both unchanged release gates pass."
parent: pm-vcs-p7objects
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-18T10:27:17.271Z",codex-agent,"Fixed the shared cause: status accepts an optional refreshCache flag (default true); all eight internal mutation-preflight callers disable cache publication. Normal public status still warms verified observations. Real cold-index regressions age filesystem entries beyond RACY_WINDOW_NS, then prove switch/reset/undo/attached-rewrite/detached-rewrite and overlapping text refusal retain raw index, refs, HEAD, operation log and private bytes. Tracker-linked command node --test --test-name-pattern=\"renewed private layer refuses|collapsed text\" test/composition.test.ts test/first-class-conflicts.test.ts passes 7/7; public cache-warming regression passes 1/1. Behavioral revert: remove only refreshCache from the cache-publication condition, leaving all callers/tests fixed. Layer suite yields 3 pass/3 fail (switch and both rewrites mutate index); collapsed-text refusal yields 0/1 pass with the same raw-index mutation. Restored protection; typecheck, lint, zero duplication and docstrings pass. Initial single-operation preflight ordering was discarded because it left rewrite and conflict-resolution refusals exposed."
